 Cloudia hangs in the balance, and only your courage can shatter the sinister grasp of the shadows. Are you ready to become a legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Join the Gaming Community: Connect with fellow adventurers, share tips, and showcase your achievements in Cloudia. Get ready for epic battles and unforgettable moments!</p>", "short_description": "Absence of Light is an action RPG inspired by the medieval era and Souls-like games. A skeleton has been incarnated in another world, on a mission to travel between realms and defeat dark entities in order to restore the light.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Arabic, Greek, Indonesian, Romanian, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Danish, Finnish, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Swedish, Czech, Ukrainian, Bulgarian, Spanish - Latin America, Hungarian, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It's OK, the difficulty is medium to high, and there is Chinese translation”<br />\r\n4/5 – 好<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“I can really tell a lot of care and effort went into this, the camera does cause a bit of issue though, I think controller support would go a long way but a fixed over the shoulder view could be welcome as well, I look forward to future updates”<br />\r\n4/5 – dyhbcdryhv<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Finally a souls-like mobile game :)”<br />\r\n5/5 – Seven Evanson<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/header.jpg?t=1766851823", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/9ed38a91457bbfa7d1525fb4e569aed1cec9f70f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766851823", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/9ed38a91457bbfa7d1525fb4e569aed1cec9f70f/capsule_184x69.